<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:40:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq Futures Sink 3% as Tech Selloff Rolls On: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</link><description>由于科技股再度下跌，削弱了投资者对风险资产的兴趣，美国国债周三全线上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment'&gt;科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasury Rally Picks Up as Stock Selloff Dents Risk Appetite&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:49:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能、美联储担忧加剧看跌情绪，金属跌势加剧</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation</link><description>铜、铝和锡都加剧了周二金属的大幅抛售，因为科技股扩大了跌幅，交易员们为美国通胀数据做好准备，这些数据将为美联储下一步的利率举措提供依据。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation'&gt;人工智能、美联储担忧加剧看跌情绪，金属跌势加剧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Metals Rout Deepens as AI, Fed Worries Fuel Bearish Sentiment&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:57:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Nvidia 仍面临市值损失 2 万亿美元的问题</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value</link><description>随着投资者开始认真思考仍然笼罩在这家全球最大芯片制造商身上的问题，英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋周一回归后，围绕该公司股价的乐观情绪正在消退。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value'&gt;Nvidia 仍面临市值损失 2 万亿美元的问题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia Still Faces Issues That Cost $2 Trillion in Market Value&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:20:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</link><description>由于中东不断升级的袭击给近几个月该地区原油运输的复苏蒙上阴影，油价小幅走高。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25'&gt;11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 25&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:06:29 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>